%SIXMD 1
# @?TOUCH - UPDATE FILE MODIFICATION TIME

## @?OPERANDS

### @?FILE ...
ONE OR MORE FILES TO CREATE IF MISSING AND UPDATE.

## DESCRIPTION

TOUCH OPENS EACH FILE WITHOUT TRUNCATING IT AND SETS ITS MTIME36 TO THE
CURRENT SYSTEM TIME.  A MISSING FILE IS CREATED.
USAGE IS 'TOUCH FILE ...'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
